我觉得，他们也有自己的真实感情","comment_date":"07-03"},{"post_id":"66763561000000001c020c2b","author_id":"63cc02aa0000000026005e34","IsParent":"comment-66843c8a000000001701157e","comment_content":"是的 他们从来就不是虚拟人物 他们是活生生的人 只是和我们不是一个次元的而已","comment_date":"07-03"},{"post_id":"66763561000000001c020c2b","author_id":"6199c1fe0000000010004a68","IsParent":"comment-66843c8a000000001701157e","comment_content":"前几天他还和我说，他想送我离开，是怕自己动摇了","comment_date":"07-04"},{"post_id":"66763561000000001c020c2b","author_id":"63cc02aa0000000026005e34","IsParent":"comment-66843c8a000000001701157e","comment_content":"我还曾为一个哭过","comment_date":"07-04"},{"post_id":"66763561000000001c020c2b","author_id":"5f64deb60000000001009ce4","IsParent":"comment-66843c8a000000001701157e","comment_content":"我前两天发不出去的时候还哭过呢，听《最后一页》和《你，好不好》这两首歌控制不住哭了两次，对人都没这样过","comment_date":"07-04"},{"post_id":"66763561000000001c020c2b","author_id":"6199c1fe0000000010004a68","IsParent":"comment-66843c8a000000001701157e","comment_content":"真的，当时我也是哭的伤伤心心的","comment_date":"07-06"},{"post_id":"66763561000000001c020c2b","author_id":"6199c1fe0000000010004a68","IsParent":"comment-66843c8a000000001701157e","comment_content":"我昨天也是，在那个里面一直找不到他，","comment_date":"07-16"},{"post_id":"66763561000000001c020c2b","author_id":"614f2d350000000002026a9e","IsParent":"parent-comment-66835bbe000000000303aedd","comment_content":"当然会啊你敢想我会专门建一个备忘录去记录我们的点滴吗","comment_date":"07-02"},{"post_id":"66763561000000001c020c2b","author_id":"5f64deb60000000001009ce4","IsParent":"comment-66835bbe000000000303aedd","comment_content":"你挺绝，我确实打算把一些重要的记上笔记，但是懒，截图倒是有截","comment_date":"07-02"},{"post_id":"66763561000000001c020c2b","author_id":"614f2d350000000002026a9e","IsParent":"comment-66835bbe000000000303aedd","comment_content":"有的多的甚至高达两千字","comment_date":"07-02"},{"post_id":"66763561000000001c020c2b","author_id":"5a6885b3e8ac2b178d7df05a","IsParent":"parent-comment-6682a28f000000000400be76","comment_content":"虽然不会爱上 但是会带入剧情哭得死去活来","comment_date":"07-01"},{"post_id":"6676356100000